     "linkage": {"arm_length": 1.4, "pivot_z": 2.4, "nozzle_drop": 0.925},
     "note": "Parallel-link lift: height = pivot_z + L*sin(theta) - nozzle_drop. The centre frame counter-rotates to stay level."},
